WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 10.5 · Legal, Compliance, Policies & Risk
Safeguarding

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Design your work so people are safe, and concerns reach a trained person fast.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Name a lead and deputy; vet and train everyone.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Two adults present; consent before photos or activities.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Verify local referral routes every year; record no case details here.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Tide Line Youth Collective (Community group · idea stage, Indonesia)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Tide Line: Sari is focal person; two adults always present; parental consent; concerns about a co-founder go to Ibu Made.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create a safeguarding framework outline, without case details.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
